{"caption":"","data":"unsolved goals\nd : ℕ\nA : ElectromagneticPotential d\n𝓕 : FreeSpace\nhA : ContDiff ℝ ∞ A.val\nJ : LorentzCurrentDensity d\nhJ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ J\nh : IsExtrema 𝓕 A J\nt : Time\nx : Space d\ni : Fin d\nhMax :\n  ∀ (t : Time) (x : Space d),\n    Space.div (electricField 𝓕.c A t) x = LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x / 𝓕.ε₀ ∧\n      ∀ (i : Fin d),\n        𝓕.μ₀ * 𝓕.ε₀ * (∂ₜ (fun t => electricField 𝓕.c A t x) t).ofLp i =\n          ∑ j, Space.deriv j (fun x => magneticFieldMatrix 𝓕.c A t x (j, i)) x -\n            𝓕.μ₀ * (LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J t x).ofLp i\nhGauss :\n  (fun y => ∑ j, Space.deriv j (fun x => (electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp j) y) = fun y =>\n    LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t y / 𝓕.ε₀\ns : Time\n⊢ ∂ₜ (fun x_1 => (electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) s = (∂ₜ (fun x_1 => electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x) s).ofLp i","endPos":{"column":28,"line":395},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/revalidation/P5/519baa4e913ee8cebeb44f2f9f7c5b09da074f991d56105f4933c26bcb7ddde6-candidate/physlib-v4.32.0/fresh/lean/002_saved_candidate/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"Tactic.unsolvedGoals","pos":{"column":46,"line":393},"severity":"error"}
