{"caption":"","data":"Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.time_deriv_time_deriv_electricField_of_isExtrema {d : ℕ}\n  {A : Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential d} {𝓕 : Electromagnetism.FreeSpace} (hA : ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) A.val)\n  (J : Electromagnetism.LorentzCurrentDensity d) (hJ : ContDiff ℝ (↑⊤) J)\n  (h : Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.IsExtrema 𝓕 A J) (t : Time) (x : Space d) (i : Fin d) :\n  Time.deriv (Time.deriv fun x_1 => (Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.electricField 𝓕.c A x_1 x).ofLp i) t =\n    𝓕.c.val ^ 2 *\n          ∑ j,\n            Space.deriv j\n              (Space.deriv j fun x => (Electromagnetism.ElectromagneticPotential.electricField 𝓕.c A t x).ofLp i) x -\n        𝓕.c.val ^ 2 / 𝓕.ε₀ * Space.deriv i (fun x => Electromagnetism.LorentzCurrentDensity.chargeDensity 𝓕.c J t x) x -\n      𝓕.c.val ^ 2 * 𝓕.μ₀ *\n        Time.deriv (fun x_1 => (Electromagnetism.LorentzCurrentDensity.currentDensity 𝓕.c J x_1 x).ofLp i) t","endPos":{"column":6,"line":419},"fileName":"/Users/hellokitsch/_feynlang/leanProject/week4/experiment/runs/20261024T000653+0900/revalidation/P5/519baa4e913ee8cebeb44f2f9f7c5b09da074f991d56105f4933c26bcb7ddde6-candidate/physlib-v4.32.0/fresh/lean/002_saved_candidate/candidate.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":419},"severity":"information"}
